WEBVTT

00:00:12.420 --> 00:00:14.510
<i>GeGeGe no Kitaro</i>

00:00:16.220 --> 00:00:18.260
To get Cat-san back,

00:00:19.310 --> 00:00:23.520
Kitaro made a crazy deal with Enma-Daio.

00:00:30.900 --> 00:00:33.740
<i>The world you see isn't all there is.</i>

00:00:34.400 --> 00:00:36.700
<i>There are things you can't see.</i>

00:00:37.070 --> 00:00:40.410
<i>See? In the darkness behind you...</i>

00:00:56.640 --> 00:01:00.310
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:00:56.640 --> 00:01:00.310
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:00.640 --> 00:01:04.230
<i>asa wa nedoko de gu gu gu</i>

00:01:00.640 --> 00:01:04.230
<i>Slumbering in bed in the morning</i>

00:01:05.060 --> 00:01:08.940
<i>tanoshiina tanoshiina</i>

00:01:05.060 --> 00:01:08.940
<i>It's so fun, it's so fun</i>

00:01:09.060 --> 00:01:12.730
<i>obakenya gakkou mo</i>

00:01:09.060 --> 00:01:12.730
<i>Ghosts don't have school</i>

00:01:12.860 --> 00:01:16.610
<i>shiken mo nannimo nai</i>

00:01:12.860 --> 00:01:16.610
<i>Or tests or anything</i>

00:01:17.200 --> 00:01:21.410
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:01:17.200 --> 00:01:21.410
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:21.540 --> 00:01:25.000
<i>minna de utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:01:21.540 --> 00:01:25.000
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:25.330 --> 00:01:29.210
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:01:25.330 --> 00:01:29.210
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:29.630 --> 00:01:33.090
<i>yoru wa hakaba de undoukai</i>

00:01:29.630 --> 00:01:33.090
<i>Sports festivals in the graveyard at night</i>

00:01:33.960 --> 00:01:37.970
<i>tanoshiina tanoshiina</i>

00:01:33.960 --> 00:01:37.970
<i>It's so fun, it's so fun</i>

00:01:38.090 --> 00:01:42.100
<i>obake wa shinanai</i>

00:01:38.090 --> 00:01:42.100
<i>Ghosts don't die</i>

00:01:42.220 --> 00:01:45.520
<i>byouki mo nannimo nai</i>

00:01:42.220 --> 00:01:45.520
<i>Or get sick or anything</i>

00:01:46.390 --> 00:01:49.980
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:01:46.390 --> 00:01:49.980
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:50.360 --> 00:01:54.320
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:01:50.360 --> 00:01:54.320
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:54.440 --> 00:01:58.280
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:01:54.440 --> 00:01:58.280
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:58.780 --> 00:02:03.240
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:01:58.780 --> 00:02:03.240
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:02:06.250 --> 00:02:07.660
<i>On kirikiri basara un hatta...</i>

00:02:07.790 --> 00:02:11.590
<i>On kirikiri basara un hatta...
On kirikiri basara un hatta...</i>

00:02:11.710 --> 00:02:13.550
<i>On kirikiri basara un hatta...</i>

00:02:18.220 --> 00:02:19.340
I did it!

00:02:19.840 --> 00:02:21.430
Well done, Rei.

00:02:22.260 --> 00:02:25.080
You have a genuine knack for this.

00:02:25.390 --> 00:02:27.420
Thank you very much, Master!

00:02:27.420 --> 00:02:31.520
But you've been practicing when
I told you to rest, haven't you?

00:02:32.400 --> 00:02:34.460
Your body won't hold up like that!

00:02:34.460 --> 00:02:39.050
But, if you hadn't adopted me, Master,

00:02:39.050 --> 00:02:41.490
I would have died back then.

00:02:43.080 --> 00:02:44.470
I want to repay you!

00:02:44.830 --> 00:02:48.350
You and everyone in
this village who look after me!

00:02:48.910 --> 00:02:51.250
That's why I'll do my best.

00:02:52.130 --> 00:02:55.690
I'll be an amazing Kidoshu
who can protect everyone!

00:02:55.690 --> 00:02:56.860
Liar.

00:02:57.630 --> 00:02:59.680
You couldn't protect anyone.

00:03:02.010 --> 00:03:03.120
Saya!

00:03:06.180 --> 00:03:08.790
The <i>yokai</i> that killed us...

00:03:08.790 --> 00:03:11.040
It's still out there!

00:03:11.040 --> 00:03:13.500
We can't be at peace!

00:03:13.980 --> 00:03:15.390
It hurts...

00:03:15.390 --> 00:03:16.500
It hurts...

00:03:17.110 --> 00:03:20.180
It hurts, Rei-chan!

00:03:20.180 --> 00:03:22.510
Help me!

00:03:33.330 --> 00:03:34.710
A dream...

00:03:39.630 --> 00:03:44.970
<i>Rei... absorbing </i>yokai<i> power</i>
<i>is a double-edged sword.</i>

00:03:45.390 --> 00:03:49.470
<i>Too much and eventually your body...</i>

00:03:49.850 --> 00:03:51.480
It doesn't matter.

00:03:58.780 --> 00:03:59.740
CHAPTER 74

00:04:00.320 --> 00:04:04.760
THE FALL OF THE UNDERWORLD?!
TAMAMO-NO-MAE'S TRAP

00:04:08.790 --> 00:04:12.100
Do you know why you've been summoned here?

00:04:12.100 --> 00:04:13.110
Yeah.

00:04:13.110 --> 00:04:14.980
You want us to hurry up.

00:04:14.980 --> 00:04:16.280
That's right.

00:04:16.280 --> 00:04:19.860
The souls of the Nue and Tamamo-no-Mae
are still missing.

00:04:20.210 --> 00:04:23.360
They must be
returned to prison immediately.

00:04:24.300 --> 00:04:28.910
The Prison of Treason uses
the weight of the souls within it

00:04:28.910 --> 00:04:31.560
to hold up the lowest level
of the underworld.

00:04:31.930 --> 00:04:33.790
Without the necessary weight,

00:04:33.790 --> 00:04:38.210
the balance with the spirit energy flowing
from the base of the underworld will tip.

00:04:38.210 --> 00:04:43.650
It could ruin the underworld, causing it
to connect to the world of the living.

00:04:45.820 --> 00:04:50.850
If you take any longer,
I will drag Catchick back here,

00:04:50.850 --> 00:04:53.770
and imprison you as a replacement weight.

00:04:54.210 --> 00:05:00.520
I'll also be forced to unleash every
guardian to hunt down Tamamo-no-Mae.

00:05:01.300 --> 00:05:04.400
It looks like we're running out of time.

00:05:04.680 --> 00:05:05.740
Yes.

00:05:05.740 --> 00:05:08.280
So, Tamamo-no-Mae...

00:05:09.260 --> 00:05:14.370
In the end of the Heian Era, her beauty
earned favor with Emperor Emeritus Toba,

00:05:14.370 --> 00:05:17.420
while she attempted to assassinate him.

00:05:17.420 --> 00:05:21.570
It's said she was, in reality,
a nine-tailed fox.

00:05:22.530 --> 00:05:27.140
It's said that, as Daji, the wife of
King Zhou of Shang, she seduced the king,

00:05:27.140 --> 00:05:30.780
making him commit
countless atrocities, right?

00:05:31.370 --> 00:05:32.370
Yes.

00:05:32.370 --> 00:05:35.650
A Yoko that has existed for
over 2,000 years...

00:05:35.650 --> 00:05:38.850
She's the most dangerous of
the Four Generals.

00:05:39.210 --> 00:05:40.590
And...

00:05:41.170 --> 00:05:42.360
Rei Isurugi...

00:05:44.010 --> 00:05:48.580
We need to take the Nue's soul
back from him, too.

00:05:48.580 --> 00:05:49.790
Yes.

00:05:49.790 --> 00:05:55.000
Hey, Kitaro-san! Daddy-san!

00:05:55.000 --> 00:05:56.750
You're back!

00:05:56.750 --> 00:05:58.000
Rollo Cloth.

00:05:58.000 --> 00:06:00.540
But are ya the only ones?

00:06:00.540 --> 00:06:02.210
Like Catchick...

00:06:02.210 --> 00:06:05.050
She's at Mt. Osore for rejuvenation.

00:06:05.050 --> 00:06:10.320
Her <i>yokai</i> power's been unstable since
her resurrection, so she goes regularly.

00:06:11.950 --> 00:06:13.220
Did something happen?

00:06:13.740 --> 00:06:16.230
Well, actually...

00:06:17.620 --> 00:06:20.600
They went to answer a letter's request
and haven't returned?

00:06:20.880 --> 00:06:22.190
Yeah.

00:06:22.190 --> 00:06:26.990
Y'all were out so Wally Wall and
Old Man Crybaby thought they'd go instead.

00:06:27.590 --> 00:06:31.450
They ain't been back in a while.
Do ya think somethin' happened?

00:06:31.450 --> 00:06:35.680
Oh very well. I'll go look for them.

00:06:36.640 --> 00:06:37.960
Hmm.

00:06:37.960 --> 00:06:42.080
Hopefully she'll find them
without incident.

00:06:51.070 --> 00:06:53.100
Sand Witch-san?

00:06:55.830 --> 00:06:59.290
The letter specified around here, but...

00:06:59.620 --> 00:07:03.790
Well, well. I didn't even ask
and another one came.

00:07:05.960 --> 00:07:07.860
Rei Isurugi?!

00:07:08.170 --> 00:07:10.300
Then this letter...

00:07:10.630 --> 00:07:13.470
Isn't it obvious? I sent it.

00:07:14.680 --> 00:07:17.160
You see, I've found the Kyubi.

00:07:17.160 --> 00:07:18.410
Wh-What?!

00:07:18.410 --> 00:07:21.590
But getting it will be difficult.

00:07:21.590 --> 00:07:23.550
Plus it's a strong one.

00:07:23.550 --> 00:07:24.670
To defeat it...

00:07:27.500 --> 00:07:30.260
I'll need even more power than I have now!

00:07:31.410 --> 00:07:34.030
So you're going to help strengthen me.

00:07:34.530 --> 00:07:36.290
Like these two did.

00:07:36.030 --> 00:07:37.240
WALL / CRY

00:07:40.180 --> 00:07:42.940
You bastard!
Old Man Crybaby and Wally Wall!

00:07:42.940 --> 00:07:45.190
Resist if you like.

00:07:45.500 --> 00:07:47.210
But if you do,

00:07:47.840 --> 00:07:50.200
I'll annihilate this one, soul and all!

00:07:50.200 --> 00:07:51.820
Sand Witch!

00:07:51.820 --> 00:07:53.320
Tofu-Kozo!

00:07:53.320 --> 00:07:57.830
It's my fault he got
Old Man Crybaby and Wally Wall!

00:07:58.180 --> 00:07:59.830
You dirty scoundrel!

00:08:00.810 --> 00:08:02.440
Say what you like.

00:08:16.240 --> 00:08:18.790
Sand Witch!

00:08:17.620 --> 00:08:19.620
SAND

00:08:23.000 --> 00:08:27.130
So... now that you're useless,
what to do...?

00:08:29.320 --> 00:08:30.110
Don't!

00:08:31.470 --> 00:08:32.610
Mana Inuyama!

00:08:32.610 --> 00:08:34.240
Why are you doing this?!

00:08:36.010 --> 00:08:39.290
To defeat Tamamo-no-Mae...
The Kyubi no Kitsune.

00:08:39.290 --> 00:08:42.790
Tamamo-no-Mae? One of those
Four Treasonous Generals?

00:08:43.190 --> 00:08:44.920
After that thing escaped,

00:08:44.920 --> 00:08:51.930
it burned the village of the Kidoshu,
the descendants of those who captured it,

00:08:51.930 --> 00:08:54.010
and slaughtered all of my friends.

00:08:54.010 --> 00:08:57.090
The elderly, women, children...
All of them!

00:08:57.090 --> 00:08:58.640
That's no reason to--

00:08:58.640 --> 00:08:59.600
Shut up!

00:09:04.460 --> 00:09:10.460
When you see Kitaro, tell him,
"Stay out of my way. I'll hunt the Kyubi.

00:09:10.800 --> 00:09:13.420
Using your friends' powers."

00:09:15.800 --> 00:09:21.200
But, he's got his deal with Enma,
so I doubt he'll back off that easily.

00:09:22.020 --> 00:09:23.330
His deal?

00:09:23.640 --> 00:09:25.830
What, you didn't know?

00:09:26.350 --> 00:09:31.780
You think he got Catchick back from the
underworld for free after you killed her?

00:09:32.860 --> 00:09:34.180
You mean...

00:09:34.180 --> 00:09:39.550
Kitaro's hunting the Four Treasonous
Generals for Cat-san and me?

00:09:44.160 --> 00:09:48.040
Otherwise he goes to
the underworld instead.

00:09:53.090 --> 00:09:58.490
What?! Wally Wall, Old Man Crybaby,
and even Sand Witch?

00:09:58.490 --> 00:10:02.430
Also... he told me that...

00:10:02.930 --> 00:10:05.040
To get Cat-san back,

00:10:05.810 --> 00:10:10.000
Kitaro made a crazy deal with Enma-Daio.

00:10:10.000 --> 00:10:12.170
So now you know.

00:10:12.610 --> 00:10:14.940
Why didn't you tell me?

00:10:15.490 --> 00:10:19.090
It's my fault. I killed Cat-san.

00:10:19.490 --> 00:10:20.430
And yet...

00:10:20.430 --> 00:10:21.930
Listen, Mana-chan.

00:10:21.930 --> 00:10:26.650
Kitaro was worried that if Catchick or you
knew about the deal you'd--

00:10:26.650 --> 00:10:28.620
It's okay, Dad.

00:10:29.750 --> 00:10:31.380
It was my decision.

00:10:31.750 --> 00:10:34.450
I decided not to get you involved in this.

00:10:34.450 --> 00:10:35.570
Why?!

00:10:35.570 --> 00:10:38.110
I know I can't fight or anything!

00:10:38.110 --> 00:10:42.510
But at least let me
worry and struggle with you!

00:10:53.270 --> 00:10:54.130
What...?

00:10:54.530 --> 00:10:56.360
There might be a war!

00:10:57.650 --> 00:11:03.330
<i>I repeat. Principality A has deployed
almost all of its war ships,</i>

00:11:03.330 --> 00:11:06.850
<i>and they are approaching Japanese waters.</i>

00:11:03.870 --> 00:11:06.750
REPRESENTATIVE OHMACHI OF PRINCIPALITY A

00:11:07.330 --> 00:11:09.570
<i>This is truly an emergency.</i>

00:11:09.570 --> 00:11:13.570
<i>Indeed. There hasn't been much tension
with that country recently,</i>

00:11:13.570 --> 00:11:15.280
<i>but there's no telling what...</i>

00:11:15.280 --> 00:11:16.360
What's wrong?

00:11:16.360 --> 00:11:17.860
That woman...

00:11:17.860 --> 00:11:19.360
Could it be...?

00:11:20.630 --> 00:11:23.470
PRINCIPALITY A
GOVERNMENT OFFICE

00:11:20.930 --> 00:11:23.570
Do you really intend to
go through with this?

00:11:23.950 --> 00:11:26.040
Is there a problem with my decision?

00:11:26.040 --> 00:11:29.290
No! Your Majesty's orders are absolute!

00:11:29.290 --> 00:11:32.250
We shall execute the invasion operation
with all our might!

00:11:32.250 --> 00:11:33.710
Good. Leave us.

00:11:33.710 --> 00:11:35.710
Yes, sir! Excuse me!

00:11:38.690 --> 00:11:41.880
Don't worry. You will surely win.

00:11:42.280 --> 00:11:43.970
Trust me.

00:11:43.970 --> 00:11:46.660
Yes. I know.

00:11:56.380 --> 00:11:58.610
OLD MAN CRYBABY

00:11:59.590 --> 00:12:03.110
WALLY WALL

00:12:01.130 --> 00:12:02.010
-<i>"Yeah, yeah. You're hot and cold."</i>
-<i>"Huh?!"</i>

00:12:02.130 --> 00:12:03.010
<i>"What'd I do?"</i>

00:12:04.340 --> 00:12:06.120
A war's starting?!

00:12:06.120 --> 00:12:07.500
Seriously?

00:12:07.500 --> 00:12:09.160
How scary!

00:12:09.160 --> 00:12:10.580
It must be a bluff.

00:12:10.580 --> 00:12:12.620
You never know with that country...

00:12:12.980 --> 00:12:14.830
Ugh, what a drag.

00:12:14.830 --> 00:12:17.710
I haven't seen
something this fishy in 80 years.

00:12:14.860 --> 00:12:17.610
PRINCIPALITY A TO INVADE JAPAN

00:12:19.940 --> 00:12:22.450
PRIME MINISTER'S RESIDENCE

00:12:19.940 --> 00:12:22.550
Huh?! Wait... you can't intervene?!

00:12:22.550 --> 00:12:26.050
Isn't this what
the security treaty is for?!

00:12:26.050 --> 00:12:29.930
We can't start anything with
that country right now.

00:12:26.070 --> 00:12:29.830
COUNTRY B
MILITARY BASE

00:12:29.930 --> 00:12:31.160
Goodbye.

00:12:31.750 --> 00:12:32.980
Like that?

00:12:32.980 --> 00:12:34.060
Yes.

00:12:34.460 --> 00:12:36.690
You did very well.

00:12:37.920 --> 00:12:40.570
You can't hold an emergency meeting?!

00:12:40.570 --> 00:12:42.880
What do you mean by that?!

00:12:43.260 --> 00:12:45.490
Secretary General?! Secretary General!

00:12:45.470 --> 00:12:48.180
COUNTRY C
UN MILITARY BUREAU

00:12:46.050 --> 00:12:47.410
Like that?

00:12:47.410 --> 00:12:48.280
Yes.

00:12:49.060 --> 00:12:51.120
You did very well.

00:12:51.120 --> 00:12:53.620
Prime Minister,
we've struck out here, too!

00:12:53.620 --> 00:12:56.900
They said, "You've got
enough military funds, do it yourself!"

00:12:58.650 --> 00:13:00.050
Like that?

00:12:58.650 --> 00:13:01.400
COUNTRY D
OFFICIAL RESIDENCE

00:13:00.050 --> 00:13:01.510
Yes.

00:13:01.780 --> 00:13:04.340
You did very well.

00:13:04.340 --> 00:13:08.760
Not just the UN, even our
neighboring countries are ignoring us!

00:13:08.760 --> 00:13:11.020
What is going on here?!

00:13:13.160 --> 00:13:18.860
If this is really the Kyubi's doing,
then Rei Isurugi is sure to act.

00:13:19.130 --> 00:13:21.450
If we could at least track him...

00:13:21.450 --> 00:13:23.070
But how?

00:13:23.070 --> 00:13:25.760
Can I try to?

00:13:31.100 --> 00:13:35.440
When I found
the body of Ibukimaru-san's lover,

00:13:36.480 --> 00:13:40.840
he gave me this paper charm
as thanks for helping him.

00:13:41.150 --> 00:13:45.840
If I use this charm
and focus on what I'm looking for,

00:13:45.840 --> 00:13:48.590
I can probably do what I did again.

00:13:50.240 --> 00:13:56.420
Kitaro, you always try to distance me
from incidents and danger.

00:13:56.870 --> 00:13:58.790
I know that.

00:13:59.670 --> 00:14:00.750
But...

00:14:01.460 --> 00:14:03.980
I want to help out how I can.

00:14:04.880 --> 00:14:06.300
Please...

00:14:07.470 --> 00:14:09.620
Let me be one of your friends, too!

00:14:14.730 --> 00:14:16.120
Hmm.

00:14:16.690 --> 00:14:20.020
This charm seems to be safe.

00:14:20.610 --> 00:14:23.190
What should we do, Kitaro?

00:14:25.360 --> 00:14:26.590
All right.

00:14:27.700 --> 00:14:29.930
Could you try, Mana?

00:14:31.780 --> 00:14:32.870
Sure!

00:14:38.370 --> 00:14:39.980
Hmm.

00:14:39.980 --> 00:14:43.190
Oh no. With the spiritual energy in
chaos as it is,

00:14:43.190 --> 00:14:47.870
if a war happens in the human world
and a flood of dead are sent here,

00:14:47.870 --> 00:14:53.390
the underworld will
completely cease to function!

00:14:56.770 --> 00:14:59.000
What are you doing, guardians?

00:14:59.000 --> 00:15:01.100
Back to your places!

00:15:02.150 --> 00:15:05.070
Everyone, what's wrong with you?!

00:15:06.110 --> 00:15:07.860
Answer me!

00:15:08.200 --> 00:15:10.910
They'll only listen to me.

00:15:15.490 --> 00:15:17.310
Y-You?!

00:15:17.960 --> 00:15:19.310
The Kyubi!

00:15:20.170 --> 00:15:21.810
KYUBI NO KITSUNE

00:15:22.810 --> 00:15:26.190
You're missing tails.
So you've sent out your duplicates.

00:15:26.550 --> 00:15:31.950
I see. So you're the one behind
this war crisis!

00:15:32.430 --> 00:15:38.730
What do you want? To start a war
and to throw Japan into chaos?!

00:15:42.980 --> 00:15:44.440
It's a secret.

00:15:47.360 --> 00:15:48.960
Curse you!

00:15:56.450 --> 00:15:58.890
PRINCIPALITY A
INSIDE THE GOVERNMENT OFFICE

00:15:58.890 --> 00:16:03.230
I've told you, His Majesty
is resting until operations begin.

00:16:03.230 --> 00:16:06.000
But, it's an emergency!

00:16:10.300 --> 00:16:12.090
Excuse me.

00:16:13.300 --> 00:16:15.330
So, did something happen?

00:16:15.330 --> 00:16:18.430
I've finally found you, Tamamo-no-Mae!

00:16:19.640 --> 00:16:20.600
MUJINA

00:16:25.360 --> 00:16:29.530
You only have one tail.
You're a duplicate.

00:16:29.530 --> 00:16:33.930
It doesn't matter.
I only have to take out one at a time.

00:16:33.930 --> 00:16:35.220
Who are you?

00:16:35.220 --> 00:16:37.930
The Kidoshu, Rei Isurugi!

00:16:37.930 --> 00:16:41.540
This is for burning down my village!

00:16:41.770 --> 00:16:43.670
Summon <i>kijin</i>!

00:16:42.920 --> 00:16:44.250
ONI

00:16:49.840 --> 00:16:52.900
Oh, a survivor?

00:16:53.340 --> 00:16:57.200
I missed one. How unlike me.

00:17:13.110 --> 00:17:16.300
I can play with you until
the main event.

00:17:16.300 --> 00:17:17.890
What?!

00:17:29.500 --> 00:17:31.000
SAND

00:17:37.890 --> 00:17:38.640
CRY

00:17:49.710 --> 00:17:50.900
WALL

00:17:57.660 --> 00:18:01.600
Curses! Where are you?! Where?!

00:18:02.620 --> 00:18:05.620
This is the end!

00:18:13.840 --> 00:18:15.010
Just kidding.

00:18:23.520 --> 00:18:25.350
Too bad for you.

00:18:27.920 --> 00:18:31.790
That's hardly enough to defeat me now.

00:18:32.820 --> 00:18:35.510
My main body is in the underworld.

00:18:35.510 --> 00:18:41.720
And spirit energy is pouring out endlessly
from the base of the Earth.

00:18:41.720 --> 00:18:45.790
I can absorb that energy directly.

00:18:46.620 --> 00:18:49.940
That overflowing energy
makes me invincible.

00:18:50.290 --> 00:18:53.730
Even Enma-Daio was no match for me.

00:19:00.800 --> 00:19:04.790
Now I'll absorb power from the underworld,

00:19:05.100 --> 00:19:07.480
and I can get serious!

00:19:21.740 --> 00:19:23.050
Kitaro!

00:19:23.330 --> 00:19:24.180
Huh?

00:19:24.540 --> 00:19:25.680
Cat-San.

00:19:25.680 --> 00:19:28.430
Mana... and Tofu-Kozo.

00:19:28.960 --> 00:19:31.650
Where's Kitaro? Where's everyone?

00:19:31.650 --> 00:19:33.090
Well...

00:19:37.590 --> 00:19:39.820
Sand Witch and the others...

00:19:39.820 --> 00:19:44.470
And... a secret bargain with Enma-Daio?

00:19:45.430 --> 00:19:46.680
Kitaro...

00:19:47.980 --> 00:19:50.480
For the two of us...

00:19:55.900 --> 00:20:00.320
<i>Hey, Kitaro, you in?! It's an emergency!</i>

00:20:01.660 --> 00:20:02.810
Kagami-Jijii?

00:20:02.810 --> 00:20:06.230
<i>Ah, Catchick! It's an emergency!</i>

00:20:06.230 --> 00:20:07.350
An emergency?

00:20:07.350 --> 00:20:11.400
<i>Listen! Enma-Daio was eaten by
the Kyubi no Kitsune.</i>

00:20:11.400 --> 00:20:15.480
<i>The underworld has fallen to her!</i>

00:20:15.480 --> 00:20:16.730
What?!

00:20:24.140 --> 00:20:25.930
Damn you...

00:20:30.600 --> 00:20:33.080
I love that expression.

00:20:33.690 --> 00:20:36.750
To see an ambitious man break,

00:20:37.070 --> 00:20:40.740
and his face fill with despair...

00:20:43.240 --> 00:20:45.120
This is the end.

00:20:55.710 --> 00:20:57.820
Spirit Hair Chanchanko!

00:21:03.430 --> 00:21:05.050
You...

00:21:05.470 --> 00:21:09.100
Just so you know,
I'm not here to help you.

00:21:10.020 --> 00:21:13.120
You're the one trying to start a war
aren't you, Tamamo-no-Mae?!

00:21:13.640 --> 00:21:15.620
What are you after?

00:21:16.020 --> 00:21:18.940
It's not just about
destroying a country, is it?

00:21:20.570 --> 00:21:23.090
It's been 800 years after all.

00:21:23.090 --> 00:21:27.890
I thought I'd destroy the underworld
as well as a country!

00:21:27.890 --> 00:21:29.220
Hair Needles!

00:21:30.950 --> 00:21:31.810
Rollo Cloth!

00:21:31.810 --> 00:21:34.060
Comin' up!

00:21:34.060 --> 00:21:34.940
Hup!

00:21:34.940 --> 00:21:37.190
Here goes!

00:21:38.020 --> 00:21:41.400
A-whoop! And a-whoop!

00:21:41.400 --> 00:21:43.360
Finger Guns!

00:21:53.100 --> 00:21:57.060
An attack like that is
hardly enough to defeat me.

00:22:01.150 --> 00:22:06.110
<i>ga ga gi gu GeGeGe no Kitaro</i>

00:22:01.150 --> 00:22:06.110
<i>Ga ga gi gu GeGeGe no Kitaro</i>

00:22:06.240 --> 00:22:09.120
<i>ga gi gu ge Go Go Go</i>

00:22:06.240 --> 00:22:09.120
<i>Ga gi gu ge Go Go Go</i>

00:22:09.240 --> 00:22:15.000
<i>ga ga gi gu GeGeGe no Kitaro</i>

00:22:09.240 --> 00:22:15.000
<i>Ga ga gi gu GeGeGe no Kitaro</i>

00:22:17.420 --> 00:22:21.300
<i>kankara kororin tsukiyo no ban ni</i>

00:22:17.420 --> 00:22:21.300
<i>Clop-clop-clop on a moonlit night</i>

00:22:21.420 --> 00:22:25.380
<i>They gather to the clopping of geta</i>

00:22:21.420 --> 00:22:25.380
<i>geta wo narashite yatsura ga atsumarya</i>

00:22:25.510 --> 00:22:29.340
<i>Daddy Eyeball in his bath bowl</i>

00:22:25.510 --> 00:22:29.340
<i>medama no oyaji chawan no furo de</i>

00:22:29.470 --> 00:22:32.760
<i>A single lecture and everyone consents</i>

00:22:29.470 --> 00:22:32.760
<i>sekkyou ippatsu nattoku</i>

00:22:32.890 --> 00:22:40.690
<i>We teach the rampant ones a lesson</i>

00:22:32.890 --> 00:22:40.690
<i>yaritai houdai no minasama niwa
okyu mo suemasu</i>

00:22:40.810 --> 00:22:45.280
<i>We can't just do nothing</i>

00:22:40.810 --> 00:22:45.280
<i>hottokenai desyo</i>

00:22:45.860 --> 00:22:51.120
<i>To the mysterious GeGeGe Forest</i>

00:22:45.860 --> 00:22:51.120
<i>fushigi na GeGeGe no Mori e</i>

00:22:51.240 --> 00:22:53.910
<i>Take a deep breath together</i>

00:22:51.240 --> 00:22:53.910
<i>issyo ni shinkokyu</i>

00:22:54.040 --> 00:22:59.790
<i>So we can live happily</i>

00:22:54.040 --> 00:22:59.790
<i>waratte kuraseru youni</i>

00:23:01.840 --> 00:23:04.510
<i>Rei Isurugi, Tamamo-no-Mae...</i>

00:23:04.630 --> 00:23:07.340
<i>Dad, what's going on in the underworld?!</i>

00:23:07.840 --> 00:23:10.390
<i>Next time on GeGeGe no Kitaro</i>

00:23:10.510 --> 00:23:12.220
<i>"Kyubi no Kitsune"</i>

00:23:12.350 --> 00:23:14.970
<i>The door to the unseen world opens...</i>
